Topic 14 – Inheritance
Objective: Understand parent-child relationships, extends, member inheritance, constructor execution and hierarchy.
No.	Program	Requirement
01	Single Inheritance	Create a parent Animal class and child Dog class. Invoke parent and child methods.
02	Single Inheritance – Employee	Create an Employee class and Manager class extending Employee.
03	Multilevel Inheritance	Create Grandparent, Parent and Child classes and invoke their methods from the Child object.
04	Multilevel – Vehicle	Create Vehicle, Car and ElectricCar classes using multilevel inheritance.
05	Hierarchical Inheritance	Create a parent Shape class and child Circle, Rectangle and Triangle classes.
06	Hierarchical – Employee	Create an Employee parent class with Developer, Tester and Manager child classes.
07	Constructor Inheritance	Demonstrate constructor execution order in parent and child classes.
08	super Keyword	Use super to access parent class variables and methods.
09	Method Overriding in Inheritance	Override a method in child classes and execute it using child objects.
10	QA Framework Inheritance	Create a BaseTest class and extend it from LoginTest and SearchTest classes.